{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/26642-simon-flannery-questions","id":26642,"title":"Simon Flannery Questions","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-12-09T12:15:44-08:00","id":26642,"title":"Simon Flannery Questions","content":"In no particular order:<ul><li>Embed: Ghost in the God Machine. Was this renamed to Voice of the Machine, or should this be something else?</li> <li>Cultist Gadget: the length of chain that saps Aether. Does this imply that demons can make Gadgets based on Form Abilities, or is this supposed to be based on Interference or Reality Enforcement?</li> <li>Form Abilities: does Simon have more than Essence Drain?</li> </ul>My apologies if someone already asked these questions in the Kickstarter comments.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1231-gapb","name":"gapb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T05:48:46-08:00","id":27919,"title":"","content":"1) Crap, I forgot he had that. Ghost in the God-Machine was an Embed that we cut. I'll make sure we fix that before the book goes to press. <br /> 2) Actually, the Players Guide has rules for making gadgets out of form powers, but that didn't exist when I wrote Simon. Assume, for now, that Simon bargained for or stole that one rather than making it himself. <br /> 3) Yes. Those words were stolen by goblins, but they've <i>totally</i> been there before and were not just missing because I forgot to put them in during development. (Doy.) Good catch. For now, let's say this form powers are: Electrical Sight, Mental Resistance, Sense the Angelic, Sonic Acuity, Essence Drain, Mirrored Skin, Phasing, Multiple Images. (He gets an extra Modification because of his Primum.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-11T12:57:32-08:00","id":28230,"title":"","content":"Thank you! Out of curiosity, what did Ghost in the God-Machine do? Unless it's coming out in a later book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1231-gapb","name":"gapb","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T05:55:31-08:00","id":28663,"title":"","content":"Here, check it out: <br /> <br /> Ghost in the God-Machine<br /> Supernatural beings have methods of detection, just as demons do. Some of these methods work by finding conscious thought, some work by spiritual fluctuation, and some work through methods that are more or less scientific (body heat, scent, etc.). But demons, as usual, can avoid these detection methods by hiding from the <i>source</i> of the power (that is, \u201csupernatural\u201d) rather than the power itself.<br /> Using this Embed too often, though, has the ironic effect of attracting angelic attention. For every use of this power during a story (failures don\u2019t count, but dramatic failures do) over the demon\u2019s Cover rating, the player most roll to avoid breaking Cover.<br /> <b>Dice Pool: </b>Wits + Stealth<br /> <b>Action: </b>Instant<br /> <b>Roll Results</b><br /> <b>Dramatic Failure: </b>Any supernatural being that enters the scene immediately sees the demon knows that she isn\u2019t normal. If the being has come into contact with demons before, then he recognizes the character as a demon.<br /> <b>Failure: </b>No effect. The demon has no special protection from supernatural detection. The character can try to activate the Embed again; apply a cumulative -1 penalty for successive roll beyond the first.<br /> <b>Success: </b>The demon is undetectable by supernatural means for the scene. This applies both to powers that would reveal the demon\u2019s presence and powers that would expose the demon as a supernatural being. If the demon activates an Exploit or assumes Demonic Form, obviously, the Embed\u2019s effects end. If the demon activates an Embed, the supernatural being in question may re-roll whatever detection it was using.<br /> <b>Exceptional Success: </b>As above, except that the demon may use Embeds a number of times equal to her Primum before the supernatural being stands a chance of noticing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T06:10:43-08:00","id":28671,"title":"","content":"So it dosn't let you transform yourself into pure code and infect the G-M? Ah well, I'll just have to suggest that later <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> If I'm right it was replaced by Spoofing?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-12-12T07:51:51-08:00","id":28727,"title":"","content":"Yeah, basically. Too similar to Spoofing. Also, I think that someone in my group suggested an Embed that became Quick Change, and so I swapped that out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}